  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> You take a hard hit on the roof of your shoulder, breaking the acromion process, with its attachments to various tendons and muscles. Though it’ll heal you’ll probably be bothered with aches and a stiff shoulder, leaving you plenty of reason to curse your dastardly foe in your old age.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> You suffer a Torn Muscle (Major). If you keep your arm immobilized and in a sling the whole time it’ll heal in half the normal time.</p>"
